<title>SPAIN: Spain gov't to approve budget on Sept 27 - Aznar.</title>
<headline>Spain gov't to approve budget on Sept 27 - Aznar.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish Prime Minister Jose Maria Aznar said on Wednesday that the government would not have its 1997 budget draft ready before the cabinet meeting on September 27.</p>
<p>&quot;The time between now and the cabinet meeting on September 27 is the time for political dialogue to define the budget with our partners and allies,&quot; Aznar told journalists at the legislature.</p>
<p>--Madrid Newsroom +34 1 585 2167</p>
</text>
